    <chapter title="Test Scenarios">
        <procedure title="Ensures that all expected menu items are visible" id="test-1">
            <p><b>Scenario:</b> Verify Menu Items Visibility</p>
            <p>Checks that all expected Admin navigation menu items are present and visible.</p>
            <p><b>Priority:</b> High</p>
            <step>Wait for page load → iterate menu_items → assert each sa-menu-item with matching text is visible.</step>
            <chapter title="Expected Results">
                <p>• All menu items are visible to Admin.</p>
            </chapter>
        </procedure>
        <procedure title="Drills into a client dashboard" id="test-2">
            <p><b>Scenario:</b> Verify Menu Items Visibility</p>
